## 4. Is it self-contained / can it drive n2048/n4096 trailing?

### What it IS
`tc_trailing_wt` + `launch_tc_wt` is a **self-contained, standalone, validated primitive** that computes **ONE of the three trailing GEMMs**: `W^T = A_trail^T @ V` (the `W = V^T @ A` reduction). It is **NOT wired into any live path** — it is dead code reachable only via `launch_tc_wt`/`_tcgen05_wt_selftest`. The active QR path was deliberately left untouched (geomean 2045us neutral, 22/22 clean).

